# Vercel serves one thing from this repo: the static dashboard in dashboard/.
# Everything else here is the Flutter app, and .dart_tool and build together
# are over 500MB against the dashboard's 312KB — uploading them times out the
# deploy rather than slowing it down.
#
# Exclude everything at the top level, then add back the two paths the
# deployment actually needs.
/*
!/dashboard
!/vercel.json
